sensor_behaviour.description:
**Radio silence:** If a sensor has not reported for this long it counts as unavailable when arming (0 = off). Battery sensors sometimes report only every few hours – choose generously.

**Role:** How a sensor triggers follows from its device class: door = entry (with entry delay), window = instant, motion/presence = follower (delays only while an entry delay is running), tamper = always reported. For an exception pick sensor and role; “Automatic” removes it again.

